    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be more enjoyable than playing a round of golf with friends while having the chance to hinder them with newly dropped items before each course?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 12 players. Different modes, play  turn-based or simultaneosly and many more custom settings options.\u00a0 Choose from over 50 holes you want to play or play randomly selected holes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a new item before each course to help you get to the hole faster or to hinder the others and get a stroke taken off. But be careful, there are also items that can destroy you and your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOME EXAMPLES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/a06ddf72b84bec9290d6409cb3b141a4.avif?t=1754675369\" data-has-big width=800 height=1786 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be more enjoyable than playing a round of golf with friends while having the chance to hinder them with newly dropped items before each course?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 12 players. Different modes, play  turn-based or simultaneosly and many more custom settings options.\u00a0 Choose from over 50 holes you want to play or play randomly selected holes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a new item before each course to help you get to the hole faster or to hinder the others and get a stroke taken off. But be careful, there are also items that can destroy you and your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOME EXAMPLES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/a06ddf72b84bec9290d6409cb3b141a4.avif?t=1754675369\" data-has-big width=800 height=1786 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
